{"id":"escape","lemma":"escape","pos":"noun","rank":2043,"glosses":["escape","leak","exhaust pipe, tailpipe"],"ipa":"/esˈkape/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"escapes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-escape.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hay un escape de gas.","en":"There's a gas leak.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"gas"}]},{"text":"No dejes que se te escape esta oportunidad.","en":"Don't let this opportunity pass you by.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610755","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"opportunity"}]},{"text":"Asegúrese de que el perro no se escape.","en":"Make sure that the dog does not escape.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/943466","words":[{"g":"to secure (to make fast","l":"asegurar"},null,null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"oneself"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"that"]]},{"text":"El escape fue poco menos que un milagro.","en":"The escape was nothing less than a miracle.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"little, not much"},{"g":"less, fewer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"miracle"}]},{"text":"Su intento de escape fue exitoso.","en":"His attempt to escape was successful.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"attempt"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"successful"}]}]}